# Crawling Barrens: the "you may" only covers becoming a creature (CR 608.2c): the two +1/+1 counters are put on it whatever is
# answered. Bot1 declines (the default answer too): it has two +1/+1 counters, is only a Land - no Elemental, no
# creature, so a 0/0 with counters does not even matter - and could not be hit by Lightning Bolt as a creature.

